  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: N/A</em></p>\n<p>You have practiced moving in medium armor to gain the following benefits, on top of proficiency with medium armor:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Wearing medium armor doesn't impose disadvantage on your Dexterity (Stealth) checks.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When you wear medium armor, you can add 3, rather than 2, to your AC if you have a Dexterity of 16 or higher.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
